ates known to a server as per =E2=80=9CThis is intended to facilitate estab=
lishment of further TPM keys, like Device Identification keys, without the =
need for an Attestation Key. This allows for simpler infrastructure impleme=
ntations.=E2=80=9D  Emphasis intended.  =F0=9F=98=8A

